<TXSPN>It is possible to view information on the events that have occurred in this world.<PG>
The incidents of this world are extremely peculiar, and I believe it would be quite difficult to remember them at a glance. When you wish to check the details of an incident again, please look here.<PG>
To the right of each incident's banner there is an icon such as '呪'; it indicates the related arc. If it says '呪,' it is an event related to the 'Jusatsu Arc [Killing by Curse].'<PG>
